2. Code that handles the state change
The key code is:
def mark_as_done(self):
    self.status = TaskStatus.DONE
    self.completed_at = datetime.now()
    self.updated_at = self.completed_at
When mark_as_done() is called:
Before: status could be TODO, IN_PROGRESS, or REVIEW.
After: status = TaskStatus.DONE
At the same time:
completed_at is set to the current date/time.
updated_at is set to the same completion time.
